ss220-ambition-debt-become-rich-name = Debt Collection
ss220-ambition-debt-become-rich-desc = I know that !NAME! owes me money. Recovering it is a matter of honor.

ss220-ambition-smoker-name = Veteran Smoker
ss220-ambition-smoker-desc = I cannot resist smoking. I need another cigarette.

ss220-ambition-drink-critic-name = Drink Critic
ss220-ambition-drink-critic-desc = I am a renowned critic. I must review every drink.

ss220-ambition-tobacco-critic-name = Tobacco Critic
ss220-ambition-tobacco-critic-desc = I am a renowned critic. I must review as many tobacco varieties as possible.

ss220-ambition-meat-critic-name = Meat Critic
ss220-ambition-meat-critic-desc = I wonder what !SPECIES! meat tastes like. I should ask for a piece.

ss220-ambition-enemy-revenge-name = A Grudge
ss220-ambition-enemy-revenge-desc = Because !REASON!, I resent !NAME!. Everyone must hear about their crimes, even if I embellish them a little.

ss220-ambition-enemy-olders-name = A Grudge
ss220-ambition-enemy-olders-desc = I hate old people! They do not belong on an advanced space station. They should all be fired, or better yet, locked up in the brig.

ss220-ambition-date-lovelas-name = Romantic
ss220-ambition-date-lovelas-desc = This station needs more romance. I will order plenty of flowers from botany and treats from the chef. The crew deserves my attention.

ss220-ambition-paranoidal-plants-name = Paranoid
ss220-ambition-paranoidal-plants-desc = I know the truth. All the plants on the station are plotting against us. They feed us oxygen so they can eventually turn us into fertilizer. I will not let this happen!

ss220-ambition-magnifier-art-name = Art Enthusiast
ss220-ambition-magnifier-art-desc = I will create a work of art at !LOCATION! worthy of my people.

ss220-ambition-self-confidence-name = Self-Confidence
ss220-ambition-self-confidence-desc = I need to praise myself and my craft. I will bribe reporters and announce the greatness of my department and myself to the entire station.

ss220-ambition-hero-in-dark-name = Hero in the Dark
ss220-ambition-hero-in-dark-desc = Light blinds and pursues me. I must get rid of it before it gets rid of me.

ss220-ambition-self-identification-name = Self-Identification
ss220-ambition-self-identification-desc = I am !SPECIES! in mind, though not in body. I will clear up this misunderstanding. Everyone must know that I am !SPECIES!.

ss220-ambition-self-identification-machine-name = Self-Identification
ss220-ambition-self-identification-machine-desc = I am a food and drink vending machine. My job? Hand out food and drinks in exchange for glowing compliments.

ss220-ambition-careerist-name = Careerist
ss220-ambition-careerist-desc = My department head is incompetent. I would be a better manager. I must get them dismissed and take their place.

ss220-ambition-implant-name = Implant Cult
ss220-ambition-implant-desc = My body is too imperfect. I want more implants, even at a cost to myself!

ss220-ambition-barefoot-name = Barefoot
ss220-ambition-barefoot-desc = Because !REASON!, I believe shoes prevent feet from breathing! I will spread the word.

ss220-ambition-socrates-name = Socrates
ss220-ambition-socrates-desc = Because !REASON!, I have started answering every question with another question.

ss220-ambition-body-building-name = The Perfect Body
ss220-ambition-body-building-desc = I have trained for years and must show everyone my impressive muscles!

ss220-ambition-blood-name = Amateur Hematologist
ss220-ambition-blood-desc = I collect blood and must expand my collection with samples from the crew, but only with their consent.

ss220-ambition-bowman-name = Archer
ss220-ambition-bowman-desc = Because !REASON!, I believe the bow is superior. I should give a crew member a masterclass.

ss220-ambition-spearman-name = Spearman
ss220-ambition-spearman-desc = Because !REASON!, I believe the spear is superior. I should give a crew member a masterclass.

ss220-ambition-agent-fan-boom-name = Explosion Enthusiast
ss220-ambition-agent-fan-boom-desc = I love explosions! Everyone else should know it too.

ss220-ambition-agent-redemption-name = Redemption
ss220-ambition-agent-redemption-desc = I will perform !COUNT! good deeds to prove that my work does not define me.

ss220-ambition-agent-fear-name = Psychological Terror
ss220-ambition-agent-fear-desc = I am addicted to other people's fear. I want everyone to be afraid of what is happening. Notes, animal corpses, and mysterious pools of blood will help.

ss220-ambition-agent-uplink-name = Old Methods
ss220-ambition-agent-uplink-desc = I am confident enough to manage without using my uplink.

ss220-ambition-agent-duel-name = Duel with the Target
ss220-ambition-agent-duel-desc = I have honor, and I will carry out my mission through a worthy duel.

ss220-ambition-agent-artist-name = Artist
ss220-ambition-agent-artist-desc = I want to accomplish my objective in a way that ushers in a new era of art.

ss220-ambition-thief-redemption-name = Redemption
ss220-ambition-thief-redemption-desc = I will perform !COUNT! good deeds to prove that my work does not define me.

ss220-ambition-compromising-evidence-name = Fear of the Boss
ss220-ambition-compromising-evidence-desc = My subordinates want to overthrow me. I will find everyone's weakness and blackmail them. They must know their place.

ss220-ambition-family-name = Family Person
ss220-ambition-family-desc = My department is my family. All my subordinates are my children, and I will not let them be in danger.

ss220-ambition-gamemaster-name = Game Master
ss220-ambition-gamemaster-desc = Luck will decide everything. A four-sided die will help me resolve every request.

ss220-ambition-festival-name = Festival
ss220-ambition-festival-desc = Today we celebrate NanoTrasen's achievements, and I must hold a festival!

ss220-ambition-festival-beer-name = Festival
ss220-ambition-festival-beer-desc = Today we celebrate beer, and I must hold a festival!

ss220-ambition-festival-security-name = Festival
ss220-ambition-festival-security-desc = Today we celebrate security, and I must hold a festival!

ss220-ambition-festival-engineering-name = Festival
ss220-ambition-festival-engineering-desc = Today we celebrate engineering, and I must hold a festival!

ss220-ambition-festival-science-name = Festival
ss220-ambition-festival-science-desc = Today we celebrate science, and I must hold a festival!

ss220-ambition-festival-medicine-name = Festival
ss220-ambition-festival-medicine-desc = Today we celebrate medical, and I must hold a festival!

ss220-ambition-festival-cargo-name = Festival
ss220-ambition-festival-cargo-desc = Today we celebrate cargo, and I must hold a festival!

ss220-ambition-festival-service-name = Festival
ss220-ambition-festival-service-desc = Today we celebrate service, and I must hold a festival!

ss220-ambition-talking-weapon-name = Talking Weapon
ss220-ambition-talking-weapon-desc = My weapon talks to me! It has become my friend.

ss220-ambition-sterility-name = Sterility
ss220-ambition-sterility-desc = Why does nobody wear shoe covers when entering medical?! I will fix this.

ss220-ambition-painkiller-name = No Pain
ss220-ambition-painkiller-desc = Injections hurt! I must make sure to administer pain relief.

ss220-ambition-pills-name = Mysterious Pills
ss220-ambition-pills-desc = I want to test the crew's luck by preparing pills with different contents.

ss220-ambition-pacifist-name = Pacifist
ss220-ambition-pacifist-desc = Because !REASON!, I believe everyone should be a little kinder. I will mix Pax into everything.

ss220-ambition-toy-name = Plush Toy
ss220-ambition-toy-desc = Every crew member should have a plush toy to relieve stress!

ss220-ambition-psychotrauma-name = Psychological Trauma
ss220-ambition-psychotrauma-desc = According to the information I received, !NAME! suffers from increased aggression. I must investigate this patient's psychological trauma.

ss220-ambition-brig-psychologist-name = Brig Psychologist
ss220-ambition-brig-psychologist-desc = Those poor prisoners break the law because of psychological problems. I will listen and help them recover.

ss220-ambition-honkbot-name = Honkbot Invasion
ss220-ambition-honkbot-desc = I think the crew is sad. Honkbots will cheer them up!

ss220-ambition-renovation-name = Renovation
ss220-ambition-renovation-desc = !LOCATION! needs modernization!

ss220-ambition-master-trade-name = Master Trader
ss220-ambition-master-trade-desc = I will persuade !NAME! to trade their clothes or other accessories for something less valuable.

ss220-ambition-underground-club-name = Underground Club
ss220-ambition-underground-club-desc = Cargo could make some money by organizing an underground betting club.

ss220-ambition-auction-club-name = Auction
ss220-ambition-auction-club-desc = Cargo could make some money by holding an auction of unusual items.

ss220-ambition-pet-name = Pet
ss220-ambition-pet-desc = I must bring a new pet home from space!

ss220-ambition-clown-name = Clown Recruitment
ss220-ambition-clown-desc = The crew is not cheerful enough. I must hire more clowns.

ss220-ambition-mime-name = Silent Mime
ss220-ambition-mime-desc = The mime has withdrawn into themselves, but I can get my friend talking.

ss220-ambition-storyteller-name = Narrator
ss220-ambition-storyteller-desc = Everything is part of a book, and I am the narrator! I must describe everything in the third person. !NAME! is the main character.

ss220-ambition-tourette-syndrome-name = Tourette Syndrome
ss220-ambition-tourette-syndrome-desc = I believe I have Tourette syndrome. I need to obtain a medical certificate to prove it.

ss220-ambition-silence-name = Silence
ss220-ambition-silence-desc = The station is too noisy. I need to convince !COUNT! crew members to take a vow of silence.

ss220-ambition-sensation-name = Sensation Hunter
ss220-ambition-sensation-desc = !NAME! promised me sensational news! If they do not deliver, I will ruin their reputation.

ss220-ambition-ghost-hunter-name = Ghost Hunter
ss220-ambition-ghost-hunter-desc = They exist! And I will prove it to my viewers.

ss220-ambition-jukebox-name = The Jukebox Is Evil
ss220-ambition-jukebox-desc = It will replace me! It is stealing my job!

ss220-ambition-delivery-name = Delivery Service
ss220-ambition-delivery-desc = I must organize a delivery service for my dishes.

ss220-ambition-salami-duel-name = Salami Duel
ss220-ambition-salami-duel-desc = I need to challenge someone to a duel using salami sticks!

ss220-ambition-birthday-name = Birthday Celebration
ss220-ambition-birthday-desc = Someone secretly told me that it is !NAME!'s birthday! I need to prepare a cake and congratulate them.

ss220-ambition-vending-enemy-name = Enemy of Vending Machines
ss220-ambition-vending-enemy-desc = Because !REASON!, I believe all snack machines are unhealthy. I must destroy them and feed the crew healthy food.

ss220-ambition-xenoracist-name = Xenoracist
ss220-ambition-xenoracist-desc = All species are animals. They should eat off the floor.

ss220-ambition-herbalist-name = Herbalist
ss220-ambition-herbalist-desc = My grandmother taught me herbal medicine. I must open my own medicinal herb shop.

ss220-ambition-firearms-name = Apostle of Gunpowder
ss220-ambition-firearms-desc = Firearms are a gift from God and must be honored. Laser and melee weapons are the devil's inventions.

ss220-ambition-laser-name = Apostle of the Laser
ss220-ambition-laser-desc = Lasers are a gift from God and must be honored. Firearms and melee weapons are the devil's inventions.

ss220-ambition-knife-name = Apostle of the Blade
ss220-ambition-knife-desc = Melee weapons are a gift from God and must be honored. Firearms and lasers are the devil's inventions.

ss220-ambition-cat-name = Apostle of the Cat Cake
ss220-ambition-cat-desc = I believe the cat cake is a god. I must serve all cats.

ss220-ambition-dog-name = Apostle of the Bread Dog
ss220-ambition-dog-desc = I believe the bread dog is a god. I must serve all dogs.

ss220-ambition-satan-name = Satan's Secretary
ss220-ambition-satan-desc = My master has ordered me to write death threats to the entire crew.
